   "stem": {
      "text": "Consider the differential equation \\( \\frac{dy}{dx} = y \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} \\). Find the particular solution \\( y = f(x) \\) with \\( f(0) = 4 \\), written as an explicit function of \\( x \\)."
